---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Welded Wire Mesh Fence Panels — 3D Fence, Prices & Specs" description="3D welded fence panels and fence systems from Anping factories: heights, wire gauges, coatings, posts and gates. Direct factory pricing.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-steel-900">Welded Wire Mesh Fence Panels</h1>
    <p>3D fence panels (curved/welded mesh fence) are the world's default security and perimeter fence: a welded mesh panel with V-shaped bends for rigidity, mounted on square or peach-shaped posts. Anping is the largest production cluster — most "European fence" and "3D panel fence" sold globally is made here.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-steel-900">Standard specifications</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Height (mm)</th><th>Panel width</th><th>Opening (mm)</th><th>Wire (mm)</th><th>Post</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>1030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.0–4.0</td><td>48 × 1.5 mm round / 50×50 square</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1230</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.5–4.5</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1530</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.0–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
        <tr><td>1830</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.5–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm round / 60×60 square</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm round / 80×80 square</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2430</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>80 × 3.0 mm round / 80×80 square</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-steel-900">Coatings</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Galvanized + polyester powder coated</strong> (RAL 6005 green, 7016 anthracite, 9005 black) — the standard, 10–15 year warranty outdoors</li>
      <li><strong>Hot-dip galvanized only</strong> — silver, for utility/agricultural use</li>
      <li>Total coating system usually 100–130 µm; ask for coating thickness test report on first order</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-steel-900">Complete system components</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Panels (with the bends — usually 2, 3 or 4 per panel)</li>
      <li>Posts + caps, with welded brackets or clamp bars</li>
      <li>Clamps/bolts, post caps, and sometimes razor wire brackets</li>
      <li>Gates: single leaf 1.0–1.5 m, double leaf up to 6 m — match the panel coating</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Quote the <strong>full system per linear meter</strong>, not panels alone — posts and fittings are 30–40% of project cost.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-steel-900">FAQ</h2>
    <details class="mb-3"><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">How much does a 3D fence panel cost FOB?</summary><p class="text-sm mt-2">Very roughly, USD 8–15 per panel for 1.53 m height powder-coated, depending on wire diameter and order size. Container loads (500+ panels) get the best rate.</p></details>
    <details class="mb-3"><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">What's the loading quantity per container?</summary><p class="text-sm mt-2">A 40'HC holds roughly 700–900 panels of 1.53 m height (packed on steel pallets) plus posts. Ask the factory for a loading plan.</p></details>
    <details class="mb-3"><summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">Does it meet security standards?</summary><p class="text-sm mt-2">Standard 3D fence is a deterrent, not anti-cut. For high security ask for anti-climb 358 mesh (76.2 × 12.7 mm, 4 mm wire) — also made in Anping.</p></details>

    <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-steel-900 text-white rounded-xl p-6">
      <p class="font-semibold text-lg">Get quotes from Anping fence factories</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 bg-accent-500 hover:bg-accent-600 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Send an inquiry →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
